  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing AdminView Component**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `AdminView.tsx` file. My focus is on the Back Of House Operations & Analytics Panel. I am planning on implementing a real-time performance chart with interactive SVG-driven visuals. The initial plan involves a line chart to trace the occupancy projection rate, but I am still working on the data display.\n\n\n**Developing Operational Displays**\n\nI\'ve expanded the AdminView component to include operational displays. I\'ve designed a revenue distribution donut SVG, showcasing revenue contributions by room type. There\'s also a CRM database listing of active reservations, plus operational checklists for live tasks. I am dynamically loading Housekeeping and In-Room Dining requests, complete with toggleable statuses. I also added pre-arrival airport transfer tracking and system operation status logs. This is coming together nicely!\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 20
      nanos: 848015961
    }
