  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Confirming Server Launch**\n\nThe server booted up flawlessly on port 3000 using `tsx server.ts` as expected. My review is complete; no further edits or tool calls are required. I\'m ready to finalize this project and summarize the completed digital operating system.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully designed and built the complete, production-ready digital hospitality system and operating platform for **SASALLE HOTEL** in Batam, Indonesia, inspired by the serene architectural minimalism of Aman, Bulgari, and French boutique resorts. \n\nThe application has been engineered as a robust **full-stack Express/React application** that is fully compiled, type-safe, and ready for deployment.\n\n### \360\237\217\233\357\270\217 Aesthetic & Layout System\n- **SASALLE Material Identity**: Standardized a high-contrast editorial look using a **Soft Ivory (#F5F1EA)** base with rich **Charcoal Black (#0B0D10)** and **Deep Brick Red (#7A3A2E)** architectural tones. Custom accents represent raw basalt stone textures, clay rosters, and glazed heritage **Hijau Nyonya** green glazes.\n- **Dual-Experience Modes (Web + Mobile-Ready)**: Implemented an interactive view mode switcher in the global header:\n  - **Desktop View**: A generous, spacious layout mimicking a premium, high-density print-design journal filled with negative space and smooth transitions.\n  - **Mobile View**: Embeds the guest-facing application inside a beautiful, high-fidelity **simulated smartphone device frame** with system notch dimensions, real-time hour synchronization, and gesture-friendly scrolling.\n- **High-End Typography**: Paired classic **Playfair Display** serif display headings with **Inter** body copy and **JetBrains Mono** for technical telemetry blocks and administrative panels.\n\n### \360\237\214\220 Complete Feature Suite\n1. **Dynamic Room Sanctuaries**: vertical, vertical-scrolling architectural cards loaded with hotlinked luxury photography and highly specific narrative content directly translated from the Google Stitch design file (The Heritage Suite, The Obsidian Studio, and The Ivory Pavilion).\n2. **Three-step Luxury Booking Wizard**: An elegant modal workflow facilitating interactive room booking:\n    - **Step I**: Sanctuary rate validation, customized packages bundling (The Botanical Spa Ritual or Epicurean Brick Manifestation), and promo code matching (e.g., promotional code `STILLNESS` applies a 15% discount).\n    - **Step II**: Pre-Arrival Preference customization (pillow configurations, room temperature sliders, custom butler pantry stocking, dietary restrictions, and S-Class / Vellfire private port transfer dispatch).\n    - **Step III**: Secure ledger confirmation presenting room rate breakdowns, service fees, and simulated room entrance codes.\n3. **Digital Room Key Emulator**: A high-fidelity screen displaying active booking references, integrated with a sliding lock mechanism (**\"SLIDE TO DISENGAGE RESTRAINT\"**) that triggers dynamic SVG tactile ripples upon unlocking room doors.\n4. **The Brick & Iron Culinary & Wellness Spa Center**: Integrates table reservations with customized guest seating choices and interactive details on natural stone heat-rituals and Clay-Wrap remedies.\n5. **AI Concierge Assistant**: Connected directly to an active **Express `/api/concierge` POST endpoint**, with fallback error-recovery logic utilizing a curated offline advisor mimicking the hotel\'s characteristic French-editorial tone. Handles fast-action guest shortcuts that dynamically inject hotel orders (e.g. Clay-Baked Batam Crab, Sumatran Peaberry Press) or room adjustments (Cooling room target to 20\302\260C).\n6. **BOH Back-of-House Operations Dashboard**: A functional central operating station displaying real-time booking statistics, revenue aggregates, interactive activity logistics, and dynamic interactive action boards where staff can toggle and complete requested dining deliveries and housekeeping assignments in real-time.\n7. **Multilingual Localization Dictionary**: Universal dictionary translation layer offering full-set localized translations dynamically toggled between **English (EN)**, **Bahasa Indonesia (BI)**, and **Mandarin (\344\270\255)** without layout shifts.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 475214473
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
