  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Clean Minimalism\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Clean Minimalism\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F5F1EA] text-[#0B0D10] font-serif overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative\\\">\\n  <nav class=\\\"w-full h-20 border-b border-[#0B0D10]/10 flex items-center justify-between px-12 z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-sans font-medium text-[#7A3A2E]\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-60\\\">The Hotel</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-60\\\">Suites</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-60\\\">Dining</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"text-3xl font-light tracking-[0.3em] uppercase absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\\\">Sasalle</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-sans font-medium\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[#0B0D10]\\\">EN</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">ID</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">ZH</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-6 py-2 border border-[#0B0D10] text-[10px] hover:bg-[#0B0D10] hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">Reservations</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0B0D10]/5 z-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-full h-full opacity-20\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#7A3A2E 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"w-[45%] h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-16 z-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-12 h-[1px] bg-[#B89B5E]\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#B89B5E] font-sans font-bold\\\">Batavia Heritage</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-7xl font-light leading-[0.9] mb-8\\\">\\n        A Quiet<br/>Sanctuary<br/>of Form\\n      </h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-lg text-[#0B0D10]/70 max-w-[340px] font-sans leading-relaxed\\\">\\n        Where French architectural restraint meets the warmth of Indonesian material heritage. A study in silence and texture.\\n      </p>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"mt-16\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#0B0D10]/20 pb-4 w-full cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-sans\\\">Terracotta Premier Suite</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#B89B5E]\\\">\342\206\222</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#0B0D10]/20 pb-4 w-full cursor-pointer opacity-50\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-sans\\\">Batam Horizon Lounge</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#B89B5E]\\\">\342\206\222</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"w-[55%] h-full p-8 relative z-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-full h-full relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #0B0D10; background-image: url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542314831-068cd1dbfeeb?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1000\'); opacity: 0.9;\\\"></div>\\n        \\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-80 h-96 bg-[#A0523D] translate-x-12 translate-y-12 rotate-[-4deg] border-[12px] border-[#F5F1EA] shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center p-8\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-white rotate-[4deg] text-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-4\\\">Feature</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-2xl font-light italic leading-tight\\\">The Clay Roster stairwell: geometry defined by light.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-12 left-12 p-8 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md w-72 shadow-lg\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-sans font-bold text-[#A7A7A7]\\\">Arrival</label>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-xl font-light\\\">14 Oct &mdash; 18 Oct</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"mb-8\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-sans font-bold text-[#A7A7A7]\\\">Guests</label>\\n            <div class=\\\"text-xl font-light\\\">02 Adults</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <button class=\\\"w-full bg-[#0B0D10] text-white py-4 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-sans font-bold\\\">Check Availability</button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <footer class=\\\"w-full h-16 border-t border-[#0B0D10]/10 px-12 flex items-center justify-between z-20 text-[#A7A7A7] font-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-8\\\">\\n      <span>Batam, Indonesia</span>\\n      <span>+62 778 456 000</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-12\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"text-[#0B0D10]\\\">Instagram</span>\\n      <span>Journal</span>\\n      <span>Contact</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex gap-4 items-center\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#7A3A2E]\\\"></div>\\n      <span>Status: Open</span>\\n    </div>\\n  </footer>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-4 h-full bg-[#7A3A2E] opacity-5 z-30 pointer-events-none\\\"></div>\\n  <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-[#0B0D10] opacity-10 z-30\\\"></div>\\n</div>\\n                    </body>\\n                  </html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Clean Minimalism\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Clean Minimalism\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"w-[1024px] h-[768px] bg-[#F5F1EA] text-[#0B0D10] font-serif overflow-hidden flex flex-col relative\\\">\\n  <nav class=\\\"w-full h-20 border-b border-[#0B0D10]/10 flex items-center justify-between px-12 z-20\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-sans font-medium text-[#7A3A2E]\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-60\\\">The Hotel</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-60\\\">Suites</span>\\n      <span class=\\\"cursor-pointer hover:opacity-60\\\">Dining</span>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"text-3xl font-light tracking-[0.3em] uppercase absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2\\\">Sasalle</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-8 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-sans font-medium\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"flex gap-3\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[#0B0D10]\\\">EN</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">ID</span>\\n        <span class=\\\"opacity-30\\\">ZH</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <button class=\\\"px-6 py-2 border border-[#0B0D10] text-[10px] hover:bg-[#0B0D10] hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">Reservations</button>\\n    </div>\\n  </nav>\\n\\n  <main class=\\\"flex-1 flex relative\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0B0D10]/5 z-0\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-full h-full opacity-20\\\" style=\\\"background-image: radial-gradient(#7A3A2E 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;\\\"></div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"w-[45%] h-full flex flex-col justify-center px-16 z-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-4\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"w-12 h-[1px] bg-[#B89B5E]\\\"></div>\\n        <span class=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-[#B89B5E] font-sans font-bold\\\">Batavia Heritage</span>\\n      </div>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-7xl font-light leading-[0.9] mb-8\\\">\\n        A Quiet<br/>Sanctuary<br/>of Form\\n      </h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-lg text-[#0B0D10]/70 max-w-[340px] font-sans leading-relaxed\\\">\\n        Where French architectural restraint meets the warmth of Indonesian material heritage. A study in silence and texture.\\n      </p>\\n      \\n      <div class=\\\"mt-16\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"flex flex-col gap-6\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#0B0D10]/20 pb-4 w-full cursor-pointer\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-sans\\\">Terracotta Premier Suite</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#B89B5E]\\\">\342\206\222</span>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#0B0D10]/20 pb-4 w-full cursor-pointer opacity-50\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-sans\\\">Batam Horizon Lounge</span>\\n            <span class=\\\"text-[#B89B5E]\\\">\342\206\222</span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"w-[55%] h-full p-8 relative z-10\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"w-full h-full relative overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #0B0D10; background-image: url(\'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542314831-068cd1dbfeeb?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=1000\'); opacity: 0.9;\\\"></div>\\n        \\n        <div class=\\\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-80 h-96 bg-[#A0523D] translate-x-12 translate-y-12 rotate-[-4deg] border-[12px] border-[#F5F1EA] shadow-xl flex items-center justify-center p-8\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"text-white rotate-[4deg] text-center\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"block text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-4\\\">Feature</span>\\n            <p class=\\\"text-2xl font-light italic leading-tight\\\">The Clay Roster stairwell: geometry defined by light.</p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"absolute top-12 left-12 p-8 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-md w-72 shadow-lg\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"mb-6\\\">\\n            <label class=\\\"block text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest mb-2 font-sans font-bold text-[#A7A7A7]\\\">Arri